/E (Ryan Ottley. The story follows Mark Grayson, a teenager who inherits extraordinary abilities from his father, Omni-Man, one of the most powerful superheroes on Earth. Mark initially regards his father as a heroic role model, but later discovers that Omni-Man is, in fact, a member of the Viltrumite Empire and was sent to Earth as part of its plan for planetary conquest. This revelation places Mark at the center of a conflict between humanity and the Viltrumites, which eventually escalates into a large-scale intergalactic war. Throughout the series, Mark struggles to protect Earth while confronting the political, military, and moral consequences of the Viltrumite Empire. )
