/E (The first thing anyone notices about Movincihawk is obviously the hair. The mohawk is basically his trademark, but there is considerably more to him than a different haircut. Movincihawk is one of the most openly sadistic members of the group. He enjoys destruction, constantly mocks other people, and has very little sympathy for anyone he considers weak. His attitude during the Invincible War is especially revealing: when Capevincible complains about the deaths of their fellow variants, Movincihawk simply dismisses them as weak and says he would have killed them himself eventually.He's also one of the strongest alternate Marks shown. His fight with the main Invincible is unusually close, with neither side being able to gain a clear advantage. Mark ultimately has to rely on strategy rather than simply overpowering him. )
