/T (Captain Pikell: Captain Pikell is a mid-ranking officer serving in the space fleet of the Coalition of Planets. He has a humanoid alien body with purple skin. Besides that he is the commander of the Venture which is a considerably unrenowned ship, his personality traits are defined by his professionalism and caution, particularly concerning Viltrumites. He exhibits a serious and professional demeanor dedicated to his duties within the Coalition. Pikell demonstrates a strong sense of caution, especially when dealing with potential Viltrumite threats or allies. He is notably skeptical of Viltrumites' loyalty, doubting that characters like Invincible can be trusted. He is firm in his beliefs and principles, particularly regarding the inherent danger he perceives from the Viltrumite race. )
/E (Captain Pikell: Captain Pikell is a mid-ranking officer serving in the space fleet of the Coalition of Planets. He has a humanoid alien body with purple skin. Besides that he is the commander of the Venture which is a considerably unrenowned ship, his personality traits are defined by his professionalism and caution, particularly concerning Viltrumites. He exhibits a serious and professional demeanor dedicated to his duties within the Coalition. Pikell demonstrates a strong sense of caution, especially when dealing with potential Viltrumite threats or allies. He is notably skeptical of Viltrumites' loyalty, doubting that characters like Invincible can be trusted. He is firm in his beliefs and principles, particularly regarding the inherent danger he perceives from the Viltrumite race. )
