/Title (Mokk: Mokk is a member of the Coalition of Planets, serving as representative of the planet of Dornin. He is a large, powerfully built humanoid alien with a striking resemblance to a lion. His entire physique is heavily muscled and defined, including his large hands, as each of his arms are tipped with faint, claw-like nails. His body is covered in a pale, whitish-tan fur. His fur flows long at the back and sides, complemented by a well-groomed, elongated beard on his chin. His eyes are distinct, featuring yellow irises set against black sclera and pupils, giving him a fierce and imposing presence. Dornians can be considered to originate from a society shaped by war and chaos in accordance with the behaviour of Battle Beast who is also aDornian.)
